WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.867 --> 00:00:02.201
- DOCTOR FORREST, DIAL 118,
PLEASE.

00:00:02.234 --> 00:00:05.071
DR. FORREST, PLEASE DIAL 1-1-8.

00:00:05.104 --> 00:00:08.041
- [sighs]

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:12.512
DON?
- YES, I'M HERE.

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:19.085
- PROMISE YOU'LL NEVER
FORGET ABOUT ME.

00:00:19.118 --> 00:00:21.587
- YES.

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:23.556
OF COURSE.

00:00:23.589 --> 00:00:27.860
- PROMISE ME YOU'LL TAKE CARE
OF OUR LITTLE GIRL.

00:00:27.893 --> 00:00:29.495
AND LOVE HER.

00:00:29.528 --> 00:00:33.867
- YES, WITH ALL MY HEART.

00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:39.705
- PROMISE ME YOU'LL STAY STRONG
FOR HER.

00:00:39.738 --> 00:00:42.508
- YES, YES.

00:00:42.541 --> 00:00:46.779
I PROMISE.

00:00:46.812 --> 00:00:52.351
- AND PROMISE ME YOU'LL NEVER
SLEEP WITH ANOTHER WOMAN.

00:00:52.384 --> 00:00:57.123
- [clicking]

00:00:57.156 --> 00:01:00.927
I HEAR YOU.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:03.029
- PROMISE ME YOU'LL TAKE CARE
OF MR. BIG FLUFFY TAIL?

00:01:03.062 --> 00:01:04.630
- YES.

00:01:04.663 --> 00:01:06.365
YES, YES, YES, DONE.

00:01:06.398 --> 00:01:11.237
THAT CAT WILL BE
THE MOST LOVED CAT IN THE WORLD.

00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:16.042
- AND THAT YOU WON'T LOOK
AT PORN.

00:01:16.075 --> 00:01:19.445
- AHH.
- HUH?

00:01:19.478 --> 00:01:21.380
- [speaking gibberish]

00:01:21.413 --> 00:01:22.748
- IS THAT YES?

00:01:22.781 --> 00:01:24.484
- CHECKY, CHECKY, CHECKY,
CHECKY, CHICKETY, CHICKETY,

00:01:24.517 --> 00:01:27.086
CHICKETY CHECK.

00:01:27.119 --> 00:01:28.154
- NO PORNOGRAPHY.

00:01:28.187 --> 00:01:31.724
- BUSTER BROWN SAYS WHAT?

00:01:31.757 --> 00:01:34.360
- IS THAT A YES?

00:01:34.393 --> 00:01:39.866
- YO BETTER BELIEVE
I HEARD WHAT YOU SAID, GIRL.

00:01:39.899 --> 00:01:41.000
- YOU LOVE ME, RIGHT?

00:01:41.033 --> 00:01:43.636
- YES, I LOVE YOU.
YES.

00:01:43.669 --> 00:01:44.804
- AND WE'RE SOUL MATES, RIGHT?

00:01:44.837 --> 00:01:47.039
- YES.

00:01:47.072 --> 00:01:49.542
- SO YOU WILL NEVER, EVER,

00:01:49.575 --> 00:01:53.079
EVER THINK OF SOMEONE ELSE
WHILE MASTURBATING, RIGHT?

00:01:53.112 --> 00:01:55.615
- [as robot]
MESSAGE RECEIVED.

00:01:55.648 --> 00:01:57.283
- I DON'T UNDERSTAND.
IS THAT A YES?

00:01:57.316 --> 00:01:59.118
-<i> YO COMPRENDE.</i>

00:01:59.151 --> 00:02:00.286
- IS THAT A PROMISE?

00:02:00.319 --> 00:02:03.356
- [goofy voice]
YOUR REQUEST HAS BEEN FILED.

00:02:03.389 --> 00:02:06.426
- SAY YOU PROMISE.

00:02:10.329 --> 00:02:14.200
- FORGET ABOUT, HUH?

00:02:14.233 --> 00:02:15.835
HUH?

00:02:15.868 --> 00:02:17.203
- I NEED TO HEAR YOU SAY IT.
- IT.

00:02:17.236 --> 00:02:18.304
- I--NO, SAY, "I PRO--

00:02:18.337 --> 00:02:20.106
I PROMISE."
- YOU PROMISE.

00:02:20.139 --> 00:02:24.744
- YOU--YOU PROMISE.

00:02:24.777 --> 00:02:26.445
SAY IT.

00:02:26.478 --> 00:02:28.814
- OKAY, "I PROMISE."
- NO AIR QUOTES.

00:02:28.847 --> 00:02:33.219
- ♪ PROMISES ARE THINGS
THAT MOTHERS-- ♪

00:02:33.252 --> 00:02:36.222
- SAY IT, SAY IT!

00:02:36.255 --> 00:02:38.124
- I PROMISE, I PROMISE.

00:02:38.157 --> 00:02:39.392
- WHAT ARE YOU PROMISING?

00:02:39.425 --> 00:02:41.494
- I PROMISE WHAT YOU SAID.

00:02:41.527 --> 00:02:42.695
- FINE, FORGET IT.

00:02:42.728 --> 00:02:47.200
- YES.
I MEAN, OKAY.

00:02:49.835 --> 00:02:53.439
- WILL YOU AT LEAST PROMISE
TO GO SEE MY MOM EVERY DAY?

00:02:53.472 --> 00:02:56.609
- SO ZERO PORNOGRAPHY?
DONE.

00:02:56.642 --> 00:02:57.977
I LIKE THAT.

00:02:58.010 --> 00:02:59.345
NURSE?

00:02:59.378 --> 00:03:01.547
FIX MY WIFE!

00:03:01.580 --> 00:03:04.851
[crying]

00:03:08.354 --> 00:03:09.589
DON'T TOUCH ME RIGHT NOW.

00:03:09.622 --> 00:03:11.591
I'M JUST--
IT'S NOT--NOT ALL ABOUT YOU.

